a-unit-word=""> percent</span></span></span></span></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(68px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4);"><button type="button">ZERO</button><button type="button">−10%</button><button type="button">+10%</button><button type="button">FULL</button></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4);"><div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-text-faint);">Fly-by-wire</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-8);"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">Arm FBW</button><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); color: var(--color-text-faint);">Bind axes via the Inputs tab, then arm to take stick control.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div>"`;

